{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-370",
  "title": "Dots",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Dots"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Looking at your reference image and the current ScrollDots implementation, I believe the goal is to create a sophisticated masking effect where:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**My Understanding of the Goal**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Core Objective**: Transform the ScrollDots component so the dots act as \"holes\" or \"windows\" that progressively reveal hidden content layered beneath the main background image, creating an effect where:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Layered Backgrounds**: We have multiple background layers stacked:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Bottom layer**: Hidden content (could be text, patterns, or different imagery)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Top layer**: Main background image that initially obscures everything"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Dots as Masks**: Each dot that appears during scroll acts as a \"hole\" that:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Punches through the main background image layer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Reveals the hidden content underneath at that exact position"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Creates the illusion of content being revealed/eroded as more dots appear"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Progressive Reveal**: As the user scrolls:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Individual dots appear (like raindrops)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Each dot reveals the underlying content through its \"hole\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Eventually, enough dots accumulate to create larger revealed areas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- The overall effect builds to a dramatic content reveal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Visual Effect**: This matches your reference image where:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Stage 1: Clean image (no dots)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Stage 2: Dots appear like raindrops, each revealing underlying content"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Stage 3: Dots fill the screen, fully revealing the hidden content beneath"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Technical Approach**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This would require:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**CSS/SVG Masking**: Using advanced masking techniques to create transparent holes"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-24",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Layered Backgrounds**: Multiple positioned background layers"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-25",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Precise Positioning**: Each dot's position must create a corresponding hole in the mask"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Performance Optimization**: Efficient rendering of potentially hundreds of mask elements"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Is this understanding aligned with your vision?** If so, we can proceed to outline a comprehensive implementation plan that builds on the existing ScrollDots component while adding these sophisticated masking capabilities."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}